  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN Trust Fund to End Violence Against Women managed by UN Women aims to end gender-based violence (GBV). The objectives of the grant are: improved access for women and girls to essential, safe and adequate GBV-related services; increased effectiveness of legislation, policies, national action, and accountability systems to prevent and end GBV; and improved prevention of GBV through changes in practices, behaviours and attitudes.</narrative>
